    Newline "\n"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// A for body falls through to the statement after the loop when it does not"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// return, so the let it accumulates into is read after the loop ends. The body"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// is not guaranteed to run (an empty collection skips it), so a return inside it"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// does not make the function's trailing return dead."
    Newline "\n"
